            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Travel and entitlements are paid IAW the Joint Travel Regulation (JTR).",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                319,
                940,
                350
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    319.0
                ],
                [
                    940.0,
                    319.0
                ],
                [
                    940.0,
                    350.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    350.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Parties agree that Employees will use Defense Travel System (DTS) and Government Travel Card (GTC) for all official travel arrangements and related expenses. If an Employee is unable to qualify for a GTC, the Employee will receive a travel advance via DTS prior to departure on TDY.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                375,
                1048,
                489
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    375.0
                ],
                [
                    1048.0,
                    375.0
                ],
                [
                    1048.0,
                    489.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    489.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Employer will notify Employees as far in advance as possible of TDY travel. An Employee may request to be excused from TDY under justifiable circumstances. If an Employee's request is denied, Management shall provide an Employee a written explanation.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                513,
                1062,
                627
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    135.0,
                    513.0
                ],
                [
                    1062.0,
                    513.0
                ],
                [
                    1062.0,
                    627.0
                ],
                [
                    135.0,
                    627.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Travel will be conducted in the most advantageous and prudent means available. The Employer will not require an Employee to use their privately owned vehicle (POV) for travel nor will an Employee be entitled to reimbursement for POV travel not previously approved and the most cost effective mode of transportation IAW the JTR and Agency policies.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                653,
                1086,
                795
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    653.0
                ],
                [
                    1086.0,
                    653.0
                ],
                [
                    1086.0,
                    795.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    795.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. In no case will TDY's be assigned to any Employee as a reward or punishment.",
